{
  "id": 351191788,
  "iid": 18516,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "bthci_evt: ToA-ToD and ToD-ToA values as signed integers",
  "description": "According to bluetooth core specification these values are 16-bit signed\nintegers, and 0x8000 means \"Time difference is not available\".\n\nThis commit updates the function `convert_time_unit_0p5_ns` to display\nthe values as integers, and to display the value 0x8000 as \"Not\navailable\".\n\nReference: Bluetooth Core Specification Version 6.0, Vol 4, Part E, Section 7.7.65.44 LE CS Subevent Result event",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2024-12-20T08:01:47.321Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-03-12T13:33:42.990Z",
