      "title": "bthci_evt: ToA-ToD and ToD-ToA values as signed integers",
      "message": "bthci_evt: ToA-ToD and ToD-ToA values as signed integers\n\nAccording to bluetooth core specification these values are 16-bit signed\nintegers, and 0x8000 means \"Time difference is not available\".\n\nThis commit updates the function `convert_time_unit_0p5_ns` to display\nthe values as integers, and to display the value 0x8000 as \"Not\navailable\".\n",
      "author_name": "Erik Sandgren",
      "author_email": "erik.sandgren@nordicsemi.no",
      "authored_date": "2024-12-20T08:41:50.000+01:00",
